[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_019]
Code 019. <=Cake is a Lie=>

[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_019_desc]
Code 019. <=Cake is a Lie=> : Aims to develop a magic-guidance device that allows the army to move quickly over short distances on the battlefield. Prototype: Mirror.

[en.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_019_TOOLTIP]
§YThere is a certain possibility of failure. §!

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_019]
代号019.「蛋糕是谎言」

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_019_desc]
代号019.「蛋糕是谎言」：旨在开发一种可以允许军队在战场上短距离快速移动的魔法引导装置。原型：镜子。

[zh.DECISION_C07_LPLAB_019_TOOLTIP]
§Y有一定可能性会失败。§!
